# Railway CLI `railway up` upload exclusions.
# Belt-and-suspenders alongside .gitignore: this repo has a 1.1GB local
# .venv/ at the root (legacy Streamlit-era Python env, never used by the
# apps/api Docker build, which installs its own deps from requirements.txt).
# Uploading it on every `railway up` was almost certainly the cause of
# repeated "Failed to create code snapshot" / upload timeout failures.

.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.next/
.git/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
storage/dev/
